    <!-- Privacy -->
    <section style="background: #131315; border-top: 1px solid #2A2A2D; border-bottom: 1px solid #2A2A2D" aria-labelledby="l2-s10">
      <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 88px 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px; align-items: center">
        <div style="flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
          <div style="font-family: 'Atkinson Hyperlegible Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7ED957">Privacy</div>
          <h2 id="l2-s10" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em">What you read stays on your phone</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #D4D4D0">Listen2 has no account to create and no analytics, and it does not collect anything about you or your documents. It only goes online when you ask it to, for example to download a voice, import a web page, or turn on iCloud Sync. A voice you make from your own reading is made on your iPhone, and the recording is not uploaded.</p>
        </div>
        <blockquote style="flex: 1 1 360px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 18px">
          <div style="width: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: #FF751F; flex-shrink: 0"></div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.45">"I live in the mountains and often don't have cell service when I'm out, so it can be worth it for me."</p>
            <cite style="font-style: normal; font-size: 15px; color: #A3A3A0">Listen2 reader</cite>
          </div>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pricing -->
    <section id="pricing" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 88px 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px; align-items: center" aria-labelledby="l2-s11">
      <div style="flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
        <div style="font-family: 'Atkinson Hyperlegible Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FF751F">Pricing</div>
        <h2 id="l2-s11" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Buy it once and keep it</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #D4D4D0">Because the voices run on your phone, there is no server bill to pass on to you, so Listen2 can be a single purchase instead of a subscription. Try everything free for 7 days. If it earns a place in your day, one purchase unlocks it for good.</p>
        <blockquote style="margin: 8px 0 0; display: flex; gap: 18px">
          <div style="width: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: #FF751F; flex-shrink: 0"></div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5">"The only feature about Voice Dream that I missed was its ability to read Daisy files, but now Listen 2 can do that also. You have developed a wonderful app."</p>
            <cite style="font-style: normal; font-size: 15px; color: #A3A3A0">Former Voice Dream user</cite>
          </div>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; border: 2px solid #FF751F; border-radius: 28px; padding: 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; background: #131315">
        <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #D4D4D0">Listen2 Full Access</div>
        <div style="font-size: 56px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em">$24.99</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #A3A3A0">One-time purchase after a free 7-day trial. Every voice engine, every feature, on your iPhone and iPad.</div>
        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/listen-2-reader/id6755753624" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 56px; padding: 0 28px; border-radius: 28px; background: #FF751F; color: #111113; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none">Start the free trial</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- More voices from readers -->
