          <figure style="margin: 0; border: 1px solid #2A2A2D; border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; background: #0B0B0C; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px"><blockquote style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5">"I really like the app because of the quite natural voices with lots of customization of the speech parameters."</blockquote><figcaption style="font-size: 15px; color: #A3A3A0">App Store review, Germany</figcaption></figure>
          <figure style="margin: 0; border: 1px solid #2A2A2D; border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; background: #0B0B0C; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px"><blockquote style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5">"Making all these voices accessible through a one-time payment is truly impressive."</blockquote><figcaption style="font-size: 15px; color: #A3A3A0">Listen2 reader</figcaption></figure>
